Hospital Management System

Version 1.0

Specifications:

Patient Management

Patient registration and login.
Store and update patient details.
Maintain patient medical history.
Search and retrieve patient records.

Appointment Management

Book appointments between patients and doctors.
View available doctors and appointment slots.
Reschedule or cancel appointments.
Maintain appointment status.

Doctor Management

Maintain doctor profiles and specializations.
View assigned appointments.
Access patient medical records.
Enter diagnosis and treatment details.

Medical Record Management

Maintain electronic patient medical records.
Store diagnosis, treatment, test results and medical history.
Allow authorized doctors to update records.

Laboratory Management

Create laboratory test requests.
Record test results.
Generate laboratory reports.
Allow doctors to view test results.
